of high conviction stocks based on the views of the fundamental equity investment teams. The Funds portfolio manager also may invest a portion of the Funds assets in securities that the portfolio manager believes may complement the Funds total risk profile. The Funds portfolio manager does not allocate a set percentage to any investment approach or security but instead seeks a flexible and diversified Fund profile. The portfolio manager also uses quantitative portfolio construction tools as part of their process.","risks":[["Quantitative Investing Risk","Quantitative Investing Risk ? The value of securities or other investments selected using quantitative analysis can perform differently from the market as a whole or from their expected performance. This may be as a result of the factors used in the analysis, the weights placed on each factor, and changes in the historical trends of the factors."],["Active Trading Risk","Active Trading Risk ? Active trading could increase the Funds transaction costs and may increase your tax liability as compared to a fund with less active trading policies. These effects may adversely affect Fund performance."]],"risk_narrative":null},"ncen":{"series":"S000081376","name":"Hartford Quality Value ETF","lei":"5493000J15AUKFBLCN75","acc":"0001410368-25-014111","filed":"2025-10-09","period":"2025-07-31","cik":1501825,"index":false,"index_affiliated":false,"index_exclusive":false,"multi_inverse":false,"fund_of_funds":false,"non_diversified":false,"track_diff_gross":null,"track_diff":null,"track_err_gross":null,"track_err":null,"lends":true,"lending_ok":true,"avg_on_loan":828750.66,"lending_income":7729.0,"expense_cap":false,"fees_waived":false,"commissions":14525.58,"principal_trades":116583828.77,"avg_net_assets":176242799.981538,"mgmt_fee":null,"net_expenses":null,"price":null,"nav":null,"derivatives_rule":true,"line_of_credit":false,"registrant":{"name":"Hartford Funds Exchange-Traded Trust","file_num":"811-23222","lei":"549300IA3XO4BB